#: ../../source/docs/common-mounting-the-gps-module.rst:13
#: 6b2a63c7a31a4fe5ac8ef66f39f66f79
msgid ""
"This page covers the mounting of GPS without an on-board compass. See "
":ref:`this page <copter:common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module>` for"
" the GPS+compass module."
msgstr ""
"本页介绍不带板载罗盘的 GPS 安装方法。带罗盘的 GPS 模块请参见 :ref:`此页面 <copter:common-installing-3dr-"
"ublox-gps-compass-module>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mounting-the-gps-module.rst:18
#: 5a8c0ce35c3849588e229c3ee5a01807
msgid "Tips on mounting the GPS module"
msgstr "GPS 模块安装要点"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mounting-the-gps-module.rst:20
#: 78ffee11238d44da8b5609f953f848b9
msgid ""
"For modules without an on-board compass, the orientation does not matter as "
"long as the square antenna side is facing up"
msgstr "对于不带板载罗盘的模块，方向无关紧要，只需确保方形天线面朝上即可"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mounting-the-gps-module.rst:22
#: 028d2be8e4f24a2fbdf2051e12a533a2
msgid ""
"The GPS should have a clear view of the sky and not be under spinning "
"propellers"
msgstr "GPS 应有清晰的天空视野，不应位于旋转的螺旋桨下方"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mounting-the-gps-module.rst:24
#: 1d1d771976154e3786a6cf1c4860d5c7
msgid ""
"It should be mounted as far away as possible from radio transmission "
"equipment (telemetry, video transmitters), motors, and ESCs."
msgstr "应尽量远离无线电发射设备（数传、图传发射机）、电机和 ESC。"

